    "user_request": "Architect, provision, and deploy a robust Microsoft Fabric Medallion data engineering solution for our Global Supply Chain & Inventory Fulfillment operations. Enforce Bronze raw batch ingestion, Silver Delta Lake deduplication with null-safe SHA-256 PII masking on vendor contacts and tax IDs, a Gold Kimball star schema warehouse with surrogate keys for inventory and logistics tracking, an analytical Direct Lake Power BI model, and an automated PySpark Data Quality reconciliation suite.",
